\fIپیش‌فرض\fR: \fBUnix/Linux: /opt/puppetlabs/puppet/public \-\- Windows: C:\eProgramData\ePuppetLabs\epuppet\epublic \-\- Non\-root user: ~/\.puppetlabs/opt/puppet/public\fR
